ontoksd:lowerBound rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                   rdfs:domain ontoksd:ScaleInterval ;
                   rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
                   rdfs:comment """Definition

Specifies the lower numeric bound of a scale interval.

Comment

The property lowerBound identifies the minimum boundary value of a ScaleInterval. Together with upperBound, it defines the numeric range covered by the interval.

For example, in the interval (3.0, 6.0], the lower bound is 3.0.""" .


