                 rdfs:domain ontoksd:Scale ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
                 rdfs:comment """Specifies the maximum numeric value of a scale.

Comment

The property maxValue indicates the upper bound of the numeric range defined by a Scale. It establishes the maximum valid score that may be expressed within that scale.

For example, a scale from 0 to 10 has maximum value 10.0.""" .


###  http://purl.org/ontoksd#minValue
ontoksd:minValue rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                 rdfs:domain ontoksd:Scale ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
                 rdfs:comment """Specifies the minimum numeric value of a scale.

Comment

The property minValue indicates the lower bound of the numeric range defined by a Scale. It establishes the minimum valid score that may be expressed within that scale.

For example, a scale from 0 to 10 has minimum value 0.0""" .


